ties.\n(Posting on social networking sites including X, using for thumbnails and headers, online printing, advertising, etc.)\nWe do not have any plans to use it for merchandise at this point, but if we have the opportunity to use it for merchandise (for sale), we would be very grateful.\n\n▶Preferred file format and size\nA4 size (2,894 x 4,093 pixel, height and width are up to you), 350dpi, psd or png of one picture, one person only, and one listener character with transparency would be greatly appreciated.\n\nI apologize if there are any parts that are difficult to understand or are impolite.\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://x.com/airamishima/status/1874649466143494646", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@210Bush/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2666863, "client_id": 3298737, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed49402d/uploads/origins/bc1af228-173c-4fad-8b0d-42c706c4822e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=195697ce05b4d30f5c7db4025e4f86bf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed49402d/uploads/origins/bc1af228-173c-4fad-8b0d-42c706c4822e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=195697ce05b4d30f5c7db4025e4f86bf, https://si.imgix.net/ed49402d/uploads/origins/bc1af228-173c-4fad-8b0d-42c706c4822e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed333ee26e5f2a4f2b1b4d79c564c5a4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed49402d/uploads/origins/bc1af228-173c-4fad-8b0d-42c706c4822e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b44aac98d55dfe660d5996e0b7646b9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed49402d/uploads/origins/bc1af228-173c-4fad-8b0d-42c706c4822e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit