 draw.\n\nI look forward to your colorful reply.\n Thank you very much.\n\nhttps://x.com/yhnlldbx0j1326/status/1851292006196343168?s=46&t=sdrOuPQx1w_NJqAvDB3JcQ", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@210Bush/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2666863, "client_id": 1342643, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd3b8b11/uploads/origins/12666a06-7adb-4a03-a847-bc083deabacc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89f42f843ce3ebcb10de97b999c35610", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd3b8b11/uploads/origins/12666a06-7adb-4a03-a847-bc083deabacc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89f42f843ce3ebcb10de97b999c35610, https://si.imgix.net/fd3b8b11/uploads/origins/12666a06-7adb-4a03-a847-bc083deabacc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e7f1e1f5385d90aa43ffe54b072b4758 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd3b8b11/uploads/origins/12666a06-7adb-4a03-a847-bc083deabacc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6509de8622cbf88c5107f589eb65f978 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd3b8b11/uploads/origins/12666a06-7adb-4a03-a847-bc083deabacc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cacbb28214898f472007d85802bec2dc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd3b8b11/uploads/origins/12666a06-7adb-4a03-a847-bc083deabacc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cacbb28214898f472007d85802bec2dc, https://si.imgix.net/fd3b8b11/uploads/origins/12666a06-7adb-4a03-a847-bc083deabacc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fda5061cad98bafca59d2e7c6aaf2bff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd3b8b11/uploads/origins/12666a06-7adb-4a03-a847-bc083deabacc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f51eff3f14a11c9c5e039b01204fa9c8 3x"}, "body": "Description of your request.\nI would like a standing picture of Yukina - the heroine of the novel \"Until the Saint is Called Again\" serialized in Chinese Bilibili!\nhttps://www.bilibili.com/read/readlist/rl508267?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0\n\n[Character Introduction]\nI created the character by fusing French military uniforms and sacred studies. Her name is Yukina, she is a beautiful and calm girl.\nShe always looks cool and elegant in her military uniform. Despite her neat and clean looks, she often shows a girl without a mouth.\nShe wore a military uniform like a ceremonial knight, with a knightly sword with a pale gold brim hanging from her waist. She wore white gloves and black boots, and her tight-fitting, easy-to-move officer's uniform looked beautiful on the thin girl's curves.\n\nI used past standing drawings and illustrations as reference:\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/1WcEir2Zum65vMwNA\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/SAiW6AqnfsvdyGYV6\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/TpAgvKodgfuqxXUC8\nIllustration:\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/RdPq5u4LvjJmsWxt6\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/BJmKoHymgzjiv8mq8\n\nPose - please feel free to use any background!\nThank you very much!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@210Bush/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2666863, "client_id": 1015488, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/25a243c9/uploads/origins/aafcf777-70f6-4e8f-973f-596b30c74a87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0756d2d535a37dc3c5e1d447e56b1859", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/25a243c9/uploads/origins/aafcf777-70f6-4e8f-973f-596b30c74a87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=